    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. do you think it could be something in the ducts themselves? like maybe something got stuck in there or there's something living in the vents causing a blockage? sounds weird but i've heard of weird things happening in old houses.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
